  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Renovated to an exceptional standard with meticulous attention to detail, this apartment offers a compelling opportunity for buyers seeking a Devonport retreat, first home, or Airbnb investment. \r\n\r\nPositioned on the second floor, the apartment enjoys a desirable north-facing aspect, with a sun-soaked balcony capturing all-day light. Inside, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms, a designer kitchen, and open-plan living that blends style with functionality. Added conveniences include a storage locker, shared laundry facilities, and a designated car park.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing, with beaches, local shops, and the charm of Devonport village all within easy reach. A well-managed body corporate and long-term maintenance plan provide peace of mind and protect your investment.\r\n\r\nHaving poured significant effort into the renovation, the current owner has decided apartment living isn't for him-he misses having a garden. That decision presents a fantastic opportunity for you to secure a beautifully finished home in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nTo download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/8Z4Y",
